{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new version of the Helsinki Metropolitan VFR scenery is now available! This is not just an upgrade for X-Plane 12 \u2013 it\u2019s a major expansion. The updated scenery includes custom-made versions of airports EFHV, EFLA, EFNS, and EFNU. As with the previous releases of FASimulations, this new version will feature breathtaking landscapes and hidden gems scattered throughout a wide area of Southern Finland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of square kilometers of detailed scenery coverage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution orthoimagery at 50 cm/pixel (approximately Zoom Level 16-17)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced resolution orthophotos around airfields for added realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes new (2025) custom-modeled airfields: EFHV (Hyvink\u00e4\u00e4), EFNS (Savikko), and EFLA (Lahti-Vesivehmaa)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EFMN and EFNU airfields carried over from the previous version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurately modeled elevated hospital helipad (EFHY)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed helipad on the passenger ship Silja Serenade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decals applied throughout the scenery for sharp terrain detail down to ground level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensively detailed Helsinki region featuring numerous new 2025-era custom models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests seamlessly integrated to match the underlying orthophoto imagery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-built HDR night lighting across the entire area \u2013 experience highly realistic night, dusk, and dawn conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom OSM-based facades throughout the region \u2013 Southern Finland's excellent OSM data ensures dense and accurate building coverage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This new version includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three newly added, custom-modeled general aviation airfields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous new buildings and updated models across the Helsinki region, reflecting recent urban growth and development</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970900?t=1761898544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970900?t=1761898544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970900/f5b162f57e5634c4a6806ddc42485be3bef00128/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761898544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970900/f5b162f57e5634c4a6806ddc42485be3bef00128/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761898544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new version of the Helsinki Metropolitan VFR scenery is now available! This is not just an upgrade for X-Plane 12 \u2013 it\u2019s a major expansion. The updated scenery includes custom-made versions of airports EFHV, EFLA, EFNS, and EFNU. As with the previous releases of FASimulations, this new version will feature breathtaking landscapes and hidden gems scattered throughout a wide area of Southern Finland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of square kilometers of detailed scenery coverage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-resolution orthoimagery at 50 cm/pixel (approximately Zoom Level 16-17)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced resolution orthophotos around airfields for added realism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes new (2025) custom-modeled airfields: EFHV (Hyvink\u00e4\u00e4), EFNS (Savikko), and EFLA (Lahti-Vesivehmaa)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EFMN and EFNU airfields carried over from the previous version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurately modeled elevated hospital helipad (EFHY)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed helipad on the passenger ship Silja Serenade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decals applied throughout the scenery for sharp terrain detail down to ground level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensively detailed Helsinki region featuring numerous new 2025-era custom models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests seamlessly integrated to match the underlying orthophoto imagery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom-built HDR night lighting across the entire area \u2013 experience highly realistic night, dusk, and dawn conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom OSM-based facades throughout the region \u2013 Southern Finland's excellent OSM data ensures dense and accurate building coverage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This new version includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three newly added, custom-modeled general aviation airfields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous new buildings and updated models across the Helsinki region, reflecting recent urban growth and development</p></li></ul>","developers":["FAsimulations"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2014780","name":"X-Plane 12"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970900/19fdb20c04a9fcce106b17dc53280c7131cace48/header.jpg?t=1761898544","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025